### Result: bus factor is fine, but the main owner is not recently active

Across 72 commits to the directory, Gonzalo Rodriguez has 27 (about 37%). That is well under the 80% single-owner threshold, and 28 distinct author names have touched the code. One of them is the `github-actions[bot]` autocorrect commit, and one person (Jonathan del Strother) appears under two emails.

