### Activity check

- No human commits in the last 90 days.
- Gonzalo's last commit to this directory was 2026-03-09. The last commit of any kind was the bot on 2026-04-14.
- Other contributors from 2026: Hye-jin Park (Jan and Feb), Mei Tanaka (Feb), Divya Rao (Jan), Jaroslav Novak (Mar).
- The older contributors (Vincent Boisard, hakanensari, Ryan Laughlin) have not touched the code in years.
